set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000 in
theorem _root_.GlobalTheory.T.ramificationIdx_dvd_of_galois_degree_dvd_unit_dvr : ∀ (S K L : Type) [CommRing S] [IsDomain S] [IsDiscreteValuationRing S] [Field K] [Algebra S K]
